# Bot1 controls M'Benga and puts two counters on Bot2's Ornithopter with Angelfire Ignition. The opponent-controlled
# creature gets exactly two counters and no hexproof: both its controller and the counter putter must be Bot1 (CR 614.5, 702.11b).

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Black Lotus
Mox Emerald
Mox Pearl
Mox Ruby
Dr. Joseph M'Benga
Angelfire Ignition
Island x16

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Mox Ruby
Ornithopter
Lightning Bolt
Island x20

